---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "@components/container.astro";
import Sectionhead from "@components/sectionhead.astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service">
  <Container>
    <Sectionhead>
      <Fragment slot="title">Terms of Service</Fragment>
      <Fragment slot="desc">Last Updated: January 25, 2026</Fragment>
    </Sectionhead>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-16 space-y-8">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl text-gray-800 mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
          By downloading, installing, or using Sileninja ("the App"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service ("Terms"). If you do not agree to these Terms, do not use the App.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl text-gray-800 mb-4">2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
          Sileninja provides ultrasonic protection technology designed to help protect your privacy by generating inaudible signals that may interfere with unauthorized audio surveillance.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl text-gray-800 mb-4">3. Subscription Terms</h2>
        
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl text-gray-700 mt-6 mb-3">3.1 Free Trial</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500 space-y-2">
          <li>New users are eligible for a 7-day free trial of Sileninja Premium</li>
          <li>You will not be charged during the trial period</li>
          <li>Cancel anytime before the trial ends to avoid charges</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl text-gray-700 mt-6 mb-3">3.2 Subscription Pricing</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500 space-y-2">
          <li>Sileninja Premium: $4.99 USD per month</li>
          <li>Prices may vary by region and are subject to change</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl text-gray-700 mt-6 mb-3">3.3 Billing</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500 space-y-2">
          <li>Payment is charged to your Apple ID account at confirmation of purchase</li>
          <li>Subscription automatically renews unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period</li>
          <li>Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period</li>
          <li>You can manage and cancel subscriptions in your App Store account settings</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl text-gray-700 mt-6 mb-3">3.4 Refunds</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500 space-y-2">
          <li>Refunds are handled by Apple according to their refund policy</li>
          <li>Contact Apple Support for refund requests</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl text-gray-800 mb-4">4. Permitted Use</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500 mb-3">
          You agree to use Sileninja only for lawful purposes and in accordance with these Terms. You agree NOT to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500 space-y-2">
          <li>Use the App to interfere with legitimate audio recording with proper consent</li>
          <li>Reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble the App</li>
          <li>Use the App in any way that violates applicable laws</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl text-gray-800 mb-4">5. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500 mb-3">
          THE APP IS PROVIDED "AS IS" WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. WE DO NOT GUARANTEE THAT:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500 space-y-2">
          <li>The ultrasonic protection will be 100% effective against all surveillance</li>
          <li>The App will be error-free or uninterrupted</li>
          <li>The App will meet your specific requirements</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl text-gray-800 mb-4">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
          TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, SILENINJA SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES ARISING FROM YOUR USE OF THE APP.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl text-gray-800 mb-4">7. Pet Safety</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500 space-y-2">
          <li>Sileninja includes a "Pet-Safe Mode" to reduce potential impact on animals</li>
          <li>Users are responsible for monitoring their pets when using the App</li>
          <li>We recommend enabling Pet-Safe Mode if you have pets</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl text-gray-800 mb-4">8. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
          All content, features, and functionality of the App are owned by Sileninja and are protected by copyright, trademark, and other intellectual property laws.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl text-gray-800 mb-4">9. Termination</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
          We reserve the right to terminate or suspend your access to the App at any time, without notice, for conduct that we believe violates these Terms or is harmful to other users.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl text-gray-800 mb-4">10. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
          We may modify these Terms at any time. Continued use of the App after changes constitutes acceptance of the new Terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl text-gray-800 mb-4">11. Governing Law</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
          These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Delaware, United States.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl text-gray-800 mb-4">12. Contact Information</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500 mb-3">For questions about these Terms, please contact us at:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500 space-y-2">
          <li>Email: <a href="mailto:support@sileninja.com" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">support@sileninja.com</a></li>
          <li>Website: <a href="/contact" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">sileninja.com/contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl text-gray-800 mb-4">13. Apple-Specific Terms</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500 space-y-2">
          <li>These Terms are between you and Sileninja, not Apple</li>
          <li>Apple has no obligation to provide maintenance or support for the App</li>
          <li>Apple is not responsible for any product warranties or claims</li>
          <li>Apple is a third-party beneficiary of these Terms</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Layout>
